  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcDiagram .NET: every shape, custom paths, images, straight, curved and elbow connectors, ports and gluing, groups and containers, undo, clipboard, JSON, PNG and SVG export, themes, snapping and guides, the palette and the read-only viewer in WinForms, WPF and Avalonia. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. Automatic layered and tree layouts, obstacle-avoiding orthogonal routing, data binding and extra layers are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
